{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pulls/592", "id": 228478816, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MjI4NDc4ODE2", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pull/592", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pull/592.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pull/592.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/issues/592", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pulls/592/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pulls/592/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/issues/592/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/statuses/6427c5a92336a71218125159964394ca34047d33", "number": 592, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fixing flaky test ShutdownListenerManagerTest.assertIsShutdownAlready", "user": {"login": "OrDTesters", "id": 44483852, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDgzODUy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44483852?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters", "html_url": "https://github.com/OrDTesters", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "In ShutdownListenerManagerTest, test assertIsShutdownAlready has a test-order dependency and fails when run after other tests even when there\u2019s no bug in the code.\r\n \r\nMore specifically, if any of the tests assertRemoveLocalInstancePathForPausedJob, assertRemoveLocalInstancePathForReconnectedRegistryCenter, or assertRemoveLocalInstancePathForPausedJob run right before assertIsShutdownAlready, then assertIsShutdownAlready will fail. The \u201ctest_job\u201d job in the JobRegistry needs to be shut down before assertIsShutdownAlready runs, and those three tests do not properly shut down the job. Other tests like assertIsNotLocalInstancePath and assertUpdateLocalInstancePath do properly shut down the job, and assertIsShutdownAlready does not fail when run after any of these two tests. The fix creates a tearDown method that shuts down the job after *every* test.", "labels": [{"id": 259133805, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwyNTkxMzM4MDU=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/shardingsphere-elasticjob/labels/enhancement", "name": "enhancement", "description": null, "color": "84b6eb", "default": true, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2018-11-05T20:20:47Z", "updated_at": "2020-05-31T15:54:32Z", "closed_at": "2020-05-31T15:54:32Z", "merged_at": "2020-05-31T15:54:32Z", "merge_commit_sha": "4b9afa40d3fcf1673f85694c9d690dd71f76c898", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "OrDTesters:fix-order-dependent-ShutdownListenerManagerTest", "ref": "fix-order-dependent-ShutdownListenerManagerTest", "repo": {"id": 154749829, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTQ3NDk4Mjk=", "name": "elastic-job-lite", "full_name": "OrDTesters/elastic-job-lite", "owner": {"login": "OrDTest